    "title": "Monster Truck Wars Crushes Cars at Austin's Luedecke Arena This Weekend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sophie Leclerc ,\n12 hours ago Ten-thousand-pound monster trucks are set to crush cars at Luedecke Arena this Saturday and Sunday, when Monster Truck Wars rolls into Austin with a three-showtime schedule built around 90-minute main events. The weekend lineup includes fan favorites Shark Attack, T-Rex, Sheriff and Outlaw, plus a real-life robot battle and kids' Power Wheel races for the smallest spectators. Read full article",
